sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser as Browser shop
    participant API as Axum API routes
    participant Store as Persistence read queries
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Browser->>API: GET /api/v1/orders/{order_id}
    API->>API: Parse order UUID
    alt Invalid order UUID
        API-->>Browser: 400 invalid_order_id
    else Valid order UUID
        API->>Store: get_order_details(order_id)
        Store->>DB: Begin read-only repeatable-read transaction
        Store->>DB: Read order header and optional shipment
        alt Order does not exist
            Store->>DB: Commit read transaction
            Store-->>API: None
            API-->>Browser: 404 order_not_found
        else Order exists
            Store->>DB: Read purchase-time item rows in same snapshot
            Store->>DB: Commit read transaction
            Store-->>API: Order, shipment, and item details
            API-->>Browser: 200 JSON order detail
        end
    end

    par Refresh order history
        Browser->>API: GET /api/v1/customers/{customer_id}/orders?limit=20&offset=0
        API->>API: Parse customer UUID and bounded pagination
        alt Invalid UUID or pagination
            API-->>Browser: 400 error envelope
        else Valid request
            API->>Store: list_customer_orders(customer_id, page)
            Store->>DB: Read customer and orders with purchase-time items
            alt Customer exists
                DB-->>Store: Orders newest first
                Store-->>API: Order records
                API-->>Browser: 200 JSON order history
            else Customer missing
                Store-->>API: CustomerNotFound
                API-->>Browser: 404 customer_not_found
            end
        end
    and Refresh notifications
        Browser->>API: GET /api/v1/customers/{customer_id}/notifications?limit=20&offset=0
        API->>API: Parse customer UUID and bounded pagination
        API->>Store: list_customer_notifications(customer_id, page)
        Store->>DB: Read customer and notifications ordered newest first
        alt Customer exists
            DB-->>Store: Notification rows
            Store-->>API: Notification records
            API-->>Browser: 200 JSON notification page
        else Customer missing
            Store-->>API: CustomerNotFound
            API-->>Browser: 404 customer_not_found
        end
    end
    Note over Store,DB: Reads use read-only repeatable-read snapshots.
    Note over Browser,API: Browser refreshes selected-customer history and notifications.
